| `secrets.scanner.release_assets.<platform>.sha256` | string | the sha256 the vendor's checksums file for v8.30.1 gives that archive | 64 lowercase hex digits | `scripts/install_scanner.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `secrets.scanner.release_assets` row | Pins the archive's sha256: an archive whose sha256 differs is exit 1 and installs nothing. To pin another platform, add its archive's file name and the sha256 from the vendor's checksums file for `secrets.scanner.rev`. | the installed program's own sha256, which the record and the source note hold | always |
